      "content": "a crack isn't enough. i've tried tiny steps and i've tried \"breathing differently\" and it's all just more of the same suffocation. it's like i'm stuck in a loop. the only way to actually stop the feeling, the only way to truly be done with this cage, is to just... end the loop entirely. there's no progress, just a slow decay. don't you think anyone would feel the same way if they were just waiting for a way out?",
